{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a86f","chatId":"45b87bc52bf84fc782f5814be0b0bd56","sessionId":null,"userId":69024,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1045,"promptTokens":1495,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:31"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0052182862956883375,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a86c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369751034,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a86c","chatId":"45b87bc52bf84fc782f5814be0b0bd56","sessionId":null,"userId":69024,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n虽然是最好的朋友，但是亚历克斯和查理支持不同的足球队。所以，当他们最喜欢的球队一起比赛的时候，他们聚集在一个酒吧里观看比赛。亚历克斯的球队在整场比赛中占据主导地位并且即将在最后一分钟取得胜利，这时查理的球队突然进了一个球，赢得了比赛。这时，亚历克斯和查理都开始大叫起来。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，查理最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 紧张\nB) 期待\nC) 爱护\nD) 失望\nE) 惊喜\nF) 自豪\n\n## 问题 2\n查理为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 当他的球队即将输掉比赛时，最后一个突然的进球使他们赢了\nB) 他最喜欢的球队在最后一刻意外地输掉了比赛\nC) 他很享受酒吧里的气氛\nD) 他很高兴看到亚历克斯不高兴","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0052182862956883375,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a86f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369751031,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0f09c59cc06c407a9e861f1a411250ae"}